  "modified": "2026-09-30T11:58:08Z",
  "details": "- fix CVE-2026-61915: double-free in the CalDAV VPATCH BYPARAM selector,\n  reachable by an authenticated calendar user patching a resource with two or\n  more properties of the matched kind\n- disable the cassandane test runner by default: its harness (imaptest plus the\n  perl test modules) is absent from the centos-stream8 repositories on every\n  architecture; the cunit suite continues to run on all architectures\n- do not free VPATCH parameters already removed by reference: the parameter\n  stays owned by libical after icalproperty_remove_parameter_by_ref(), so the\n  following icalparameter_free() double-freed it and aborted the CalDAV worker\n  on any VPATCH carrying a PATCH-ACTION parameter, before the CVE-2026-61915\n  code path could be reached\n- use strcmpsafe/strncmpsafe for PATCHACTION string matching:\n  icalparameter_get_xvalue() and icalproperty_get_value_as_string() may return\n  NULL on the same VPATCH path",
